@ previous, current, next code -> draws them into PICT: "prev  110 349",
@ the big digits, "next  902 115" (fixed widths, so they overwrite in place).
@ Layout must match tools/hpgrob.py (big digits at x=11+17k (+6 after the 3rd), y=18).
\<< \-> pc code nc
  \<<
    PICT "prev  " pc FMT7 + 9 CTXT
    { { #11d #18d } { #28d #18d } { #45d #18d } { #68d #18d } { #85d #18d } { #102d #18d } }
    \-> xy
    \<<
      1 6 FOR k
        PICT xy k GET DIGS code k k SUB NUM 47 - GET REPL
      NEXT
    \>>
    PICT "next  " nc FMT7 + 40 CTXT
  \>>
\>>
